# Copy to .env for local use. .env is gitignored; this file is not, so never put
# a real value in it.

# The password half of the basic-auth gate in middleware.ts. The username is
# fixed at `thinq`. Set the real value in Vercel → Settings → Environment
# Variables, for every environment you want reachable. If it is unset, the
# deployment answers 503 rather than serving the page — that is deliberate.
#
# The middleware only runs on Vercel, so `vite dev` is unaffected by this.
SITE_PASSWORD=
